{"pageid":2620,"title":"Petalfall","displaytitle":"<span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Petalfall</span>","revid":22118,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><table class=\"notice\" style=\"border-radius:15px; border:3px solid #FCBA03; background:#6e470c; font-size:90%; width:100%\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"10\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/4/44/Hexagon_Construction.png/revision/latest?cb=20250626004512\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Hexagon Construction\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Hexagon Construction.png\" data-image-key=\"Hexagon_Construction.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/4/44/Hexagon_Construction.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/100?cb=20250626004512\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><p style=\"margin-bottom:.3em\"><span style=\"font-size:125%; font-weight:bold\">This page is under construction!</span><br />\n<span>This page is currently undergoing structural revisions. Please wait patiently until it is fully updated! You can help the Oaklands Wiki by <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://oaklands.fandom.com/wiki/Petalfall?action=edit\">expanding it</a>.</span></p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default type-wood\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title1\">Petalfall</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image1\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/f/fb/Petalfall.png/revision/latest?cb=20240419130837\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Petalfall\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/f/fb/Petalfall.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20240419130837\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/f/fb/Petalfall.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20240419130837 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/f/fb/Petalfall.png/revision/latest?cb=20240419130837 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Petalfall\" width=\"270\" height=\"152\" data-image-key=\"Petalfall.png\" data-image-name=\"Petalfall.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tStats\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tInfo\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Swing Power\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Swing Power</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">0.7</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Swing Distance\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Swing Distance</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">20 Studs</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Swing Time\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Swing Time</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">0.5</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Price\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Price</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">4 special eukaryotes</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1.54.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">April 14th, 2024</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p>The <b>Petalfall</b> is an axe obtained through completing a puzzle involving multiple \"flowers\" (one is only classified as a flower in the game), It has a swing power bonus towards <a href=\"/wiki/Sakura\" title=\"Sakura\">Sakura Trees</a>.\n</p>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Details\">Details</span></h2>\n<p>The Petalfall is obtained by placing 4 special, glowing eukaryotes (\"flowers\") (three flowers and one mushroom) inside temples around the flowering meadows.\n</p><p>It has a passive ability to fell sakura trees with one swing.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n<p>The Petalfall Katana has a swing power of 0.7 making it only ever so slightly weaker than the Reinforced Axe with a 0.8 swing power, however, it's swing time being more than four times faster actually makes it significantly better than any other axe in the game excluding the <a href=\"/wiki/Emberbane\" title=\"Emberbane\">emberbane</a> because of it's ability to randomly strike a tree multiple times in one swing.\n</p><p><b>-- OUTDATED --</b>\n</p><p>The <a href=\"/wiki/Gravity_Coil\" title=\"Gravity Coil\">Gravity Coil</a> may be needed to obtain the axe.\n</p><p>You can go to Flowering meadows via Mike’s mines to avoid spending money on bombs.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Obtaining\">Obtaining</span></h2>\n<dl><dd><i>Notes:</i>\n<ul><li><i>If all the flowers are owned by the same person, Petalfall will be in that player's ownership when it spawns. Otherwise, it will spawn with no owner and could potentially be stolen.</i></li>\n<li><i>*When the first Flower in one of the Towers it starts a timer of 15-20 minutes before all temples reset.</i></li></ul></dd></dl>\n<p>Tutorial on how to get it linked below:\n</p><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VYqpjV9hEj4\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VYqpjV9hEj4</a> - OUTDATED\n</p><p>And the whole tutorial written here\n</p><p>Gather the <b>four flowers</b>:\n</p>\n<ul><li>The <a href=\"/wiki/Blizzard_Bloom\" title=\"Blizzard Bloom\">Blizzard Bloom</a></li>\n<li>The <a href=\"/wiki/Tamed_Mysterious_Mushroom\" title=\"Tamed Mysterious Mushroom\">Tamed Mysterious Mushroom</a></li>\n<li>The <a href=\"/wiki/Corpse_Flower\" title=\"Corpse Flower\">Corpse Flower</a></li>\n<li>The <a href=\"/wiki/Burning_Blossom\" title=\"Burning Blossom\">Burning Blossom</a></li></ul>\n<p>With the flowers acquired, proceed to the next steps.\n</p><p>Go to the area around <a href=\"/wiki/Flora_Laura\" title=\"Flora Laura\">Flora Laura</a> called the <a href=\"/wiki/Flowering_Meadows\" title=\"Flowering Meadows\">Flowering Meadows</a>. Here you find 5 temples the 4 smaller ones are the ones you place the flowers. After placing a <a href=\"/wiki/Flowers\" title=\"Flowers\">Flower</a> the top of the temple should show a purplish beam.\n</p>\n<figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/e/e4/Ice_flower_temple.png/revision/latest?cb=20250605235516\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Blizzard Bloom temple\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"114\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Ice flower temple.png\" data-image-key=\"Ice_flower_temple.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/e/e4/Ice_flower_temple.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20250605235516\" /></a> \t<noscript><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/e/e4/Ice_flower_temple.png/revision/latest?cb=20250605235516\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Blizzard Bloom temple\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/e/e4/Ice_flower_temple.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20250605235516\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"114\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Ice flower temple.png\" data-image-key=\"Ice_flower_temple.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/e/e4/Ice_flower_temple.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20250605235516\" /></a></noscript> \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Ice_flower_temple.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">Blizzard Bloom temple</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<ul><li>Take the <a href=\"/wiki/Blizzard_Bloom\" title=\"Blizzard Bloom\">Blizzard Bloom</a> to the beach area underneath the <a href=\"/wiki/Flowering_Meadows\" title=\"Flowering Meadows\">Flowering Meadows</a>. You will find a waterfall, behind that there's a temple where you place the flower inside the bowl.</li></ul>\n<figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 188px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/6/66/Purple_Shroom_Temple.png/revision/latest?cb=20250606000505\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Tamed Mysterious Mushroom temple\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"188\" height=\"162\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Purple Shroom Temple.png\" data-image-key=\"Purple_Shroom_Temple.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/6/66/Purple_Shroom_Temple.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/188?cb=20250606000505\" /></a> \t<noscript><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/6/66/Purple_Shroom_Temple.png/revision/latest?cb=20250606000505\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Tamed Mysterious Mushroom temple\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/6/66/Purple_Shroom_Temple.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/188?cb=20250606000505\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"188\" height=\"162\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Purple Shroom Temple.png\" data-image-key=\"Purple_Shroom_Temple.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/6/66/Purple_Shroom_Temple.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/188?cb=20250606000505\" /></a></noscript> \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Purple_Shroom_Temple.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">Tamed Mysterious Mushroom temple</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<ul><li>Next go up to the same level as <a href=\"/wiki/Flora_Laura\" title=\"Flora Laura\">Flora Laura</a>. On a large rock which you can only climb by foot is the temple for the <a href=\"/wiki/Tamed_Mysterious_Mushroom\" title=\"Tamed Mysterious Mushroom\">Tamed Mysterious Mushroom</a>. Once again place the flower into the bowl and a purplish beam should emerge on top.</li></ul>\n<figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/8/80/Corpse_Flower_temple.png/revision/latest?cb=20250606001121\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Corpse Flower temple\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"165\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Corpse Flower temple.png\" data-image-key=\"Corpse_Flower_temple.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/8/80/Corpse_Flower_temple.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20250606001121\" /></a> \t<noscript><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/8/80/Corpse_Flower_temple.png/revision/latest?cb=20250606001121\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Corpse Flower temple\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/8/80/Corpse_Flower_temple.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20250606001121\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"165\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Corpse Flower temple.png\" data-image-key=\"Corpse_Flower_temple.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/8/80/Corpse_Flower_temple.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20250606001121\" /></a></noscript> \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Corpse_Flower_temple.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">Corpse Flower temple</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<ul><li>For the third flower you drive to the other side of the valley staying on the same level as <a href=\"/wiki/Flora_Laura\" title=\"Flora Laura\">Flora Laura</a>. The green temple is for the <a href=\"/wiki/Corpse_Flower\" title=\"Corpse Flower\">Corpse Flower</a>. Drive over the rock bridge and up to the temple and place the <a href=\"/wiki/Corpse_Flower\" title=\"Corpse Flower\">Corpse Flower</a> into the bowl. Another purplish beam should appear.</li></ul>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<ul><li>The last flower is the <a href=\"/wiki/Burning_Blossom\" title=\"Burning Blossom\">Burning Blossom</a>. I advise you to do this one last as driving down there will shake up your truck or force you to walk all the way around.\n<ul><li>Jump WITH the flower to the same level as the temple, place the flower and reset to base <small>(<i>This is currently the least frustrating way some people found without extra tools).</i></small></li></ul></li></ul>\n<figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/4/45/Burning_Blossom_Temple.png/revision/latest?cb=20250606001600\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Burning Blossom temple\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"195\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Burning Blossom Temple.png\" data-image-key=\"Burning_Blossom_Temple.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/4/45/Burning_Blossom_Temple.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20250606001600\" /></a> \t<noscript><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/4/45/Burning_Blossom_Temple.png/revision/latest?cb=20250606001600\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Burning Blossom temple\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/4/45/Burning_Blossom_Temple.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20250606001600\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"195\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Burning Blossom Temple.png\" data-image-key=\"Burning_Blossom_Temple.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/4/45/Burning_Blossom_Temple.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20250606001600\" /></a></noscript> \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Burning_Blossom_Temple.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">Burning Blossom temple</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p>\nAfter all flowers have been placed they should disappear and the sword should appear in the brown temple at the highest peak of the <a href=\"/wiki/Flowering_Meadows\" title=\"Flowering Meadows\">Flowering Meadows</a>. Pick it up from the same kind of bowl as you placed the flowers.</p><figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 251px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/9/9f/Petalfall_Spawn_temple.png/revision/latest?cb=20250606002526\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"The brown temple where the sword spawns\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"251\" height=\"153\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Petalfall Spawn temple.png\" data-image-key=\"Petalfall_Spawn_temple.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/9/9f/Petalfall_Spawn_temple.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/251?cb=20250606002526\" /></a> \t<noscript><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/9/9f/Petalfall_Spawn_temple.png/revision/latest?cb=20250606002526\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"The brown temple where the sword spawns\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/9/9f/Petalfall_Spawn_temple.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/251?cb=20250606002526\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"251\" height=\"153\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Petalfall Spawn temple.png\" data-image-key=\"Petalfall_Spawn_temple.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/9/9f/Petalfall_Spawn_temple.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/251?cb=20250606002526\" /></a></noscript> \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Petalfall_Spawn_temple.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">The brown temple where the sword spawns</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<dl><dd><i>Note: The temples have a cooldown which prevents the creation of multiple Petalfall Katanas in a short time. One may place as many flowers as they like in their respective temples, but only one set of flowers (one of each flower) will be consumed, and only one Petalfall will spawn - on an interval of fifteen minutes after the last Petalfall was spawned.</i></dd></dl>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 265px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/2/27/Petalfall_Temple.png/revision/latest?cb=20250606002412\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Petalfall spawn\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"265\" height=\"173\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Petalfall Temple.png\" data-image-key=\"Petalfall_Temple.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/2/27/Petalfall_Temple.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/265?cb=20250606002412\" /></a> \t<noscript><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/2/27/Petalfall_Temple.png/revision/latest?cb=20250606002412\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Petalfall spawn\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/2/27/Petalfall_Temple.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/265?cb=20250606002412\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"265\" height=\"173\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Petalfall Temple.png\" data-image-key=\"Petalfall_Temple.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/2/27/Petalfall_Temple.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/265?cb=20250606002412\" /></a></noscript> \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Petalfall_Temple.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">Petalfall spawn</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p>[OUTDATED]\n</p>\n<ul><li>Take the <a href=\"/wiki/Blizzard_Bloom\" title=\"Blizzard Bloom\">Blizzard Bloom</a> and go to the tower near <a href=\"/wiki/Flora_Laura\" title=\"Flora Laura\">Flora Laura</a>. There will be visible steps. Once on top place the flower inside the tower.</li></ul>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"f6bfd105b5c889820f97e00c72f3aad6\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:106px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"FirstPFTower-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:104px; width:185px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:FirstPFTower.png\" title=\"FirstPFTower.png (5.68 MB)\" style=\"height:104px; width:185px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/2/21/FirstPFTower.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20240524033755\" title=\"FirstPFTower.png (5.68 MB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"104\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"FirstPFTower.png\" data-image-key=\"FirstPFTower.png\" data-relevant=\"1\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"FirstPFTower.png (5.68 MB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"104\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"FirstPFTower.png\" data-image-key=\"FirstPFTower.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/2/21/FirstPFTower.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20240524033755\" /></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:106px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"FirstPFTower1-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:104px; width:185px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:FirstPFTower1.png\" title=\"FirstPFTower1.png (4.45 MB)\" style=\"height:104px; width:185px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/6/6d/FirstPFTower1.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20240530231344\" title=\"FirstPFTower1.png (4.45 MB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"104\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"FirstPFTower1.png\" data-image-key=\"FirstPFTower1.png\" data-relevant=\"1\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"FirstPFTower1.png (4.45 MB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"104\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"FirstPFTower1.png\" data-image-key=\"FirstPFTower1.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/6/6d/FirstPFTower1.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20240530231344\" /></a></div></div></div></div>\n<ul><li>Take the <a href=\"/wiki/Tamed_Mysterious_Mushroom\" title=\"Tamed Mysterious Mushroom\">Tamed Mysterious Mushroom</a> and head to the cave. Near the entrance there should be a pink-broken piece of wall. Above it there's a hole in the ceiling. Climb the stone ledge with the mushroom, make your way to the top of the cave. Every jump should lead you higher and higher. Once on top, place the mushroom inside the tower.\n<ul><li>In Alpha Version 1.5.5, this was near impossible, as the cave would lead you out of bounds.</li></ul></li></ul>\n<div id=\"gallery-1\" hash=\"1500ec7942da02ccd95c0aedca3ae4b1\" data-seq-no=\"1\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:106px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"SecondPFCave1-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:104px; width:185px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:SecondPFCave1.png\" title=\"SecondPFCave1.png (6.63 MB)\" style=\"height:104px; width:185px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/a/ae/SecondPFCave1.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20240524033508\" title=\"SecondPFCave1.png (6.63 MB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"104\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"SecondPFCave1.png\" data-image-key=\"SecondPFCave1.png\" data-relevant=\"1\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"SecondPFCave1.png (6.63 MB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"104\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"SecondPFCave1.png\" data-image-key=\"SecondPFCave1.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/a/ae/SecondPFCave1.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20240524033508\" /></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:106px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"SecondPFCave2-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:104px; width:185px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:SecondPFCave2.png\" title=\"SecondPFCave2.png (4.75 MB)\" style=\"height:104px; width:185px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/2/20/SecondPFCave2.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20240524033505\" title=\"SecondPFCave2.png (4.75 MB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"104\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"SecondPFCave2.png\" data-image-key=\"SecondPFCave2.png\" data-relevant=\"1\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"SecondPFCave2.png (4.75 MB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"104\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"SecondPFCave2.png\" data-image-key=\"SecondPFCave2.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/2/20/SecondPFCave2.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20240524033505\" /></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:106px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"SecondPFCave155OOB-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:104px; width:185px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:SecondPFCave155OOB.png\" title=\"SecondPFCave155OOB.png (3.71 MB)\" style=\"height:104px; width:185px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/1/14/SecondPFCave155OOB.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20240524033502\" title=\"SecondPFCave155OOB.png (3.71 MB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Out of bounds as seen in a older version\" height=\"104\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"SecondPFCave155OOB.png\" data-image-key=\"SecondPFCave155OOB.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Out of bounds as seen in a older version\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"SecondPFCave155OOB.png (3.71 MB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Out of bounds as seen in a older version\" height=\"104\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"SecondPFCave155OOB.png\" data-image-key=\"SecondPFCave155OOB.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Out of bounds as seen in a older version\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/1/14/SecondPFCave155OOB.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20240524033502\" /></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">Out of bounds as seen in a older version</div></div></div>\n<ul><li>Take the remaining flowers, and make your way to a pole with rope. To locate the pole head to Flora Laura from the cave but take the first turn to right, taking you of the brown path. Walk on the rope with both flowers, then take the incline to the left and take another rope.\n<ul><li>Take the <a href=\"/wiki/Burning_Blossom\" title=\"Burning Blossom\">Burning Blossom</a> and head underwater, there's a hole in the bottom. Once inside the room place the flower inside the tower.</li></ul></li></ul>\n<div id=\"gallery-2\" hash=\"ccce21434eed57d17e6251e82a2a1683\" data-seq-no=\"2\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:106px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"ThirdPFTower-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:104px; width:185px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:ThirdPFTower.png\" title=\"ThirdPFTower.png (4.04 MB)\" style=\"height:104px; width:185px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/d/d6/ThirdPFTower.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20240530232244\" title=\"ThirdPFTower.png (4.04 MB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"104\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"ThirdPFTower.png\" data-image-key=\"ThirdPFTower.png\" data-relevant=\"1\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"ThirdPFTower.png (4.04 MB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"104\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"ThirdPFTower.png\" data-image-key=\"ThirdPFTower.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/d/d6/ThirdPFTower.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20240530232244\" /></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:106px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"ThirdPFTower1-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:104px; width:185px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:ThirdPFTower1.png\" title=\"ThirdPFTower1.png (3.56 MB)\" style=\"height:104px; width:185px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/e/ec/ThirdPFTower1.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20240530232248\" title=\"ThirdPFTower1.png (3.56 MB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"104\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"ThirdPFTower1.png\" data-image-key=\"ThirdPFTower1.png\" data-relevant=\"1\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"ThirdPFTower1.png (3.56 MB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"104\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"ThirdPFTower1.png\" data-image-key=\"ThirdPFTower1.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/e/ec/ThirdPFTower1.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20240530232248\" /></a></div></div></div></div>\n<ul><li>Take the <a href=\"/wiki/Corpse_Flower\" title=\"Corpse Flower\">Corpse Flower</a>, and walk across the tightropes making your way to the mountain as shown below. Grab your corpse flower and then swim up the waterfall making your way to the shrine, then place it down.</li></ul>\n<div id=\"gallery-3\" hash=\"e92b078f5ef18dc83effa981a9c261be\" data-seq-no=\"3\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:119px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Tightrope_1-4-jpg\" style=\"position: relative; height:117px; width:185px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Tightrope_1.4.jpg\" title=\"Tightrope 1.4.jpg (3.06 MB)\" style=\"height:117px; width:185px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/9/91/Tightrope_1.4.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20250325233957\" title=\"Tightrope 1.4.jpg (3.06 MB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"the first tightrope on a mountain.\" height=\"117\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Tightrope 1.4.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Tightrope_1.4.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"the first tightrope on a mountain.\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"Tightrope 1.4.jpg (3.06 MB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"the first tightrope on a mountain.\" height=\"117\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Tightrope 1.4.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Tightrope_1.4.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"the first tightrope on a mountain.\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/9/91/Tightrope_1.4.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?c