<div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">The corpse flower shrine at the top of the waterfall.</div></div></div>\n<ul><li>Take the rope yet again. Use the waterfalls to get to top of the tallest island. Enter the middle tower and jump in the hole. There is a statue holding the katana.</li></ul>\n<div id=\"gallery-4\" hash=\"302d4f14ca261c71ff0c075c8944fe43\" data-seq-no=\"4\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:106px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"FifthPFTower-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:104px; width:185px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:FifthPFTower.png\" title=\"FifthPFTower.png (5.72 MB)\" style=\"height:104px; width:185px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/f/f9/FifthPFTower.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20240530232251\" title=\"FifthPFTower.png (5.72 MB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"104\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"FifthPFTower.png\" data-image-key=\"FifthPFTower.png\" data-relevant=\"1\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"FifthPFTower.png (5.72 MB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"104\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"FifthPFTower.png\" data-image-key=\"FifthPFTower.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/f/f9/FifthPFTower.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20240530232251\" /></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:106px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"FifthPFTower1-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:104px; width:185px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:FifthPFTower1.png\" title=\"FifthPFTower1.png (4.25 MB)\" style=\"height:104px; width:185px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/8/8b/FifthPFTower1.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20240530232251\" title=\"FifthPFTower1.png (4.25 MB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"104\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"FifthPFTower1.png\" data-image-key=\"FifthPFTower1.png\" data-relevant=\"1\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"FifthPFTower1.png (4.25 MB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"104\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"FifthPFTower1.png\" data-image-key=\"FifthPFTower1.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/8/8b/FifthPFTower1.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20240530232251\" /></a></div></div></div></div>\n<ul><li>Continue going downwards and through the water cave to exit.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>The Petalfall is currently the tallest axe in-game.</li>\n<li>This axe is arguably the best one next to <a href=\"/wiki/Emberbane\" title=\"Emberbane\">Emberbane</a> in the game as of version 1.56.0 as it got heavily buffed. While it does not one hit trees, it compensates with having one of the fastest swing speeds.</li>\n<li>Unlike other tools, the Petalfall does not have an animation for being held, instead being placed in the arm.</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260901072507\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.057 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.068 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 139/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 661/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6/2097152 bytes\nHighes